{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object nearby, take it, check properties, perform task. Otherwise, move and scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToFindObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
